stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Running
    Running --> LockTimeout: lock not acquired
    Running --> PartialUpgrade: module migration failed or process stopped
    Running --> ValidationFailed: post-apply validation failed
    Running --> Compatible: apply and validation passed

    LockTimeout --> InspectOwner
    InspectOwner --> PreflightAgain: owner completed or aborted
    PartialUpgrade --> FreezeRelease
    ValidationFailed --> FreezeRelease
    FreezeRelease --> ClassifyDatabase
    ClassifyDatabase --> RollForward: state understood and artifact reviewed
    ClassifyDatabase --> RestoreCandidate: roll-forward cannot meet incident objective
    RestoreCandidate --> RestoreApproved: verified restore point and three-party approval
    RestoreApproved --> PreflightAgain
    RollForward --> PreflightAgain
    PreflightAgain --> Running
    Compatible --> AppRollbackCheck
    AppRollbackCheck --> Compatible: old image schema-compatible
    AppRollbackCheck --> FreezeRelease: incompatible old image
    Compatible --> [*]
